Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 10:01:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add Empress Bulblax (Queen) sampled actor with #227
 policy mirror (#256)

FSM Dead0/Sleep1/Wait2/Damage3/Flick4/Rolling5/Born6 with deferred
next-state at sampled clip loop end, disc key frames, rolling passes with
territory crash + side alternation, actor-local Pikmin receivers
(Pikmin-only damage coefficients, punch/quake immunity by construction),
tiered flick shake-off, bounded 50-slot larva pool with 50/25 hysteresis
and 2.0 s birth interval, f_01 variant (no larvae, HP 3300, easy first
roll), l_02 crash rocks recorded-but-disabled. New strict P2_QUEEN_ACTOR_1
config; P2_BULBLAX_VISUAL_1 untouched. Additive hooks only (CMake,
preview setup, teki reset blocks, core update/draw).
